    "detailed_description": "Welcome to A Matching Game! This is a simple game of selecting two cards and trying to find more matches than your opponent. Enjoy some lo-fi music as you try to beat Robo Dog in levels that get progressively harder. The further you get into the game, the smarter Robo Dog becomes!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are 30 levels to play against Robo Dog<br></li><li> Time Trial modes (Mini, Large and Mega) to test your speed<br></li><li> Lo-fi music to enjoy while playing<br></li><li> 20 different avatars to choose from<br></li><li> 8 different card backs to unlock <br></li><li> A Family Friendly game, great for all ages!</li></ul>",
